What it is redistributed **as**:

| Redistributed artefact | Origin in the legacy tree | Measurement |
|---|---|---|
| 5 UXML pages + 1 USS (`Assets/CommNextRedux/UI/`) | `src/CommNext.Unity/CommNext.Unity/Assets/UI/` | vendored in P2; the port's own markup is an edit of these |
| 18 PNG images (`Assets/CommNextRedux/UI/Images/`) | `src/CommNext.Unity/.../Assets/Images/` | `cmp` byte-identical for all 18 |
