| `localizations/commnext_localizations.csv` | `plugin_template/localizations/commnext_localizations.csv` | derived; cut to the keys this port can paint (see §4) |
| The ported C# behaviour (`Assets/CommNextRedux/Code/`) | `src/CommNext/` and `src/CommNext.Unity/` | re-authored against the pinned API, following the legacy's design |

```bash
# the asset-identity proof, as run in this repo
# LEGACY below = the pre-Redux CommNext checkout, kept outside this repository
cd mods/CommNextRedux
LEGACY=${LEGACY:-/path/to/pre-Redux/CommNext}
for f in Assets/CommNextRedux/UI/Images/*.png; do
  b=$(basename "$f")
  cmp -s "$f" "$LEGACY/src/CommNext.Unity/CommNext.Unity/Assets/Images/$b" \
    && echo "same  $b" || echo "DIFF  $b"
done
```

